Dependencies resolved at build time
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No source from these is copied into this repository. SwiftPM fetches duet from
the URL in Package.swift; Gradle fetches every coordinate in
kotlin/gradle/libs.versions.toml. Their own licenses govern their use.

  duet — https://github.com/modaal-agent/duet — MIT License
    Linked by DuetDiagnostics, DuetAppServices and DuetTelemetry, and by the
    Kotlin :telemetry module. DuetTheming links nothing.

  kotlinx-serialization — https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.serialization — Apache License 2.0
    The Kotlin :telemetry module.

  kotlinx-coroutines — https://github.com/Kotlin/kotlinx.coroutines — Apache License 2.0
    A published dependency of the Kotlin :theming module, and a test
    dependency of :telemetry.
